19533::$$$message_0160_0000_0000$$$::"Ahhh. That was a nice bath. [hffacechg chara=イリヤ face=楽 layer=1 time=200][l][say storage=HIRIE_IRI_0020 _name=イリヤ]What's wrong, Shirou? You look tired."::
19534::$$$message_0160_0000_0001$$$::"Um, Illya? Anyone would be exhausted having to bathe next to Berserker[line len=2][hffacechg chara=士郎 face=バッテン layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][l][say storage=HIRIE_SHI_0020 _name=士郎]wagh!"::
19535::$$$message_0160_0000_0002$$$::"Ahahahaha. This is called a 'pillow fight,' isn't it? Here, have another!"::
19536::$$$message_0160_0000_0003$$$::"Argh! Did Fuji-nee teach you this!? I thought I told you not to throw things."::
19537::$$$message_0160_0000_0004$$$::"Ahahaha, surrendering already? Patheeetic."::
19538::$$$message_0160_0000_0005$$$::"Darn it! You're not used to wearing a bathrobe yet! If you jump around like that, it'll..."::
19539::$$$message_0160_0000_0006$$$::"[wacky len=5][line len=3]!!!"::
19540::$$$message_0160_0000_0007$$$::"Bwargh!"::
19541::$$$message_0160_0000_0008$$$::"Hehehe. That's why you shouldn't let your guard down, Shirou. [hffacechg chara=イリヤ face=喜 layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1][l][say storage=HIRIE_IRI_0070 _name=イリヤ]All right, get him, Berserker!"::
19542::$$$message_0160_0000_0009$$$::"[wacky len=5][line len=3]!"::
19543::$$$message_0160_0000_0010$$$::"Illya, wait! That'll kill m[hffacechg chara=士郎 face=バッテン layer=1 time=200][hfangry layer=1][line len=2]"::
